\par\par \b \uc2 Press Release: \uc2 McGraw Hill\uc2  Expands Its AI-Powered ALEKS Product Portfolio\b0\par\par\uc2 924 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 June 2026\par 14:57\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 New releases include ALEKS Adventure for Grades 4--5 and ALEKS for Calculus II\par \par \uc2 Key Highlights: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    --  \f28 \uc2 \f2 McGraw Hill\f28 \uc2 \f2  is expanding its AI-powered ALEKS portfolio with ALEKS \par       Adventure for Grades 4--5 and ALEKS for Calculus II. \par  \par    --  ALEKS Adventure now offers a complete K--5 experience, while \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  for \par       Calculus II extends personalized support as students progress through the \par       calculus sequence. \par  \par    --  \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  uniquely provides comprehensive assessment of a student's \par       knowledge from Kindergarten-level math through Calculus while using AI \par       and learning science to personalize instruction and identify knowledge \par       gaps. \par  \par    --  \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  has supported more than 65 million students for 25+ years and \par       continues to see strong adoption across K--12 and higher education as \par       demand grows for personalized supplemental and intervention math \par       support. \par COLUMBUS, Ohio--(BUSINESS WIRE)--June 29, 2026-- \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As educators work to improve math outcomes, demand continues to grow for effective solutions that support student progress at every stage of the learning journey.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This press release features multimedia. View the full release here: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260629677144/en/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260629677144/en/}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 McGraw Hill\f28 \uc2 \f2  is expanding its AI-powered ALEKS portfolio with ALEKS Adventure for Grades 4--5 and ALEKS for Calculus II. ALEKS Adventure now offers a complete K--5 experience, while \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  for Calculus II extends personalized support as students progress through the calculus sequence.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 To help meet that need, \f28 \uc2 \f2 McGraw Hill, Inc.\f28 \uc2 \f2  (NYSE: MH), a leading global provider of education solutions for preK-12, higher education and professional learning, today announced new additions to its AI-powered ALEKS portfolio of learning solutions: ALEKS Adventure for Grades 4--5 and ALEKS for Calculus II. These new offerings extend the reach of ALEKS, which is already being used by students globally at other course levels and alongside core \f28 \uc2 \f2 McGraw Hill\f28 \uc2 \f2  programs such as Reveal Math.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For more than 25 years, \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  has used \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 artificial intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and learning science to help personalize instruction for more than 65 million students from elementary school through higher education. Its adaptive technology and actionable data help educators identify knowledge gaps and guide each student to the skills they are ready to learn next.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "\f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  is widely used across K--12 and higher education globally as a trusted solution for personalized math instruction," said Lori Anderson, Chief Product Officer at \f28 \uc2 \f2 McGraw Hill\f28 \uc2 \f2 . "These additions expand its reach across grade levels and advanced math courses, creating new opportunities to support customers while positioning the \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  product for continued growth in the years ahead."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ALEKS Adventure for Grades 4--5\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 With the addition of Grades 4--5, ALEKS Adventure now offers a complete K--5 experience, building on Grades K--3, which are already being used by schools and educators globally. Built on the same proven ALEKS model, the new offerings combine rigorous math learning with shorter lessons, guided practice and frequent mastery checks tailored for older elementary students.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Alongside familiar characters like Digit the Dog, students participate in engaging, bite-sized learning experiences in short 10--15 minute chunks that fit naturally into classroom routines and support skill development through age-appropriate digital learning.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Students using \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  generally achieve topic mastery more than 90% of the time, and recent case studies of ALEKS Adventure in early elementary classrooms showed that usage led to significant point gains in assessment scores and stronger end-of-year math performance.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ALEKS for Calculus II\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ALEKS for Calculus II follows the 2025 release of Calculus I, extending personalized support further into the calculus sequence.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Using AI-driven machine learning based on billions of \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  data points, \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  for Calculus II helps students build on prior learning as they move into more advanced concepts, reinforcing foundational knowledge and supporting deeper conceptual understanding as coursework becomes more complex.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Together with Calculus I--and with Calculus III planned for release during the 2027--28 academic year--it creates a connected, continuous path for students as they advance, supporting steady progress toward mastery in higher-level math.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "\f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  reflects our teacher-centric approach to AI by leveraging data to provide educators with clear insights into student knowledge gaps so they can better support what each learner is ready to tackle next," said Anderson. "Whether a student is building foundational skills in elementary school or progressing through Calculus II, \f28 \uc2 \f2 ALEKS\f28 \uc2 \f2  enables educators to meet each learner where they are and provide the individualized support needed to keep moving forward."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ALEKS Adventure for Grades 4--5 and ALEKS for Calculus II are now available. Learn more about ALEKS: \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    --  ALEKS for K-12 \par  \par    --  ALEKS for Higher Education \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 McGraw Hill\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 McGraw Hill (NYSE: MH) is a leading global provider of education solutions for preK-12, higher education and professional learning, supporting the evolving needs of millions of educators and students around the world. We provide trusted, high-quality content and personalized learning experiences that use data, technology and learning science to help students progress towards their goals. Through our commitment to fostering a culture of innovation and belonging, we are dedicated to improving outcomes and access to education for all. We have over 30 offices across North America, Asia, Australia, Europe, the Middle East and South America, and make our learning solutions available in more than 80 languages. Visit us at mheducation.com or find us on Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn or X.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 View source version on businesswire.com: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260629677144/en/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260629677144/en/}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     CONTACT:    Ben Roselieb \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 McGraw Hill\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 614-673-3454\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ben.roselieb@mheducation.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 June 29, 2026 08:57 ET (12:57 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260629em6t001yc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
