\par\par \b \uc2 Dow Jones Top Company Headlines at 5 PM ET: ON Semiconductor to Buy Synaptics in All-Stock Deal with $7 Billion Enterprise Value | \uc2 Bayer\uc2  ...\b0\par\par\uc2 598 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2026\par 23:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 ON Semiconductor to Buy Synaptics in All-Stock Deal with $7 Billion Enterprise Value\par \par \uc2 ON Semiconductor\uc2  said \uc2 Synaptics\uc2 's AI compute platform, human-machine interface technology, and connectivity solutions would help it meet demand for increasingly capable AI solutions that can interact with the physical world.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Bayer\uc2  Wins Supreme Court Challenge Over Roundup Litigation\par \par \uc2 The decision will help the company in its bid to resolve thousands of claims that the popular weedkiller caused cancer.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  Shakes Up Dimon Succession Race With Two New Presidents\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  named \uc2 Doug Petno\uc2  and \uc2 Troy Rohrbaugh\uc2  as co-presidents of the company, laying the groundwork to find candidates to succeed chief executive \uc2 Jamie Dimon\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Apple\uc2  Raises Prices on Macs, iPads by $200 or More on Some Models\par \par \uc2 The increases come a week after \uc2 Tim Cook\uc2  said higher memory costs made them "unavoidable."\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 FedEx Freight\uc2  Guides for Growth After Spinoff from \uc2 FedEx\par \par \uc2 The company expects revenue to grow 4% to 6% for June 1 to Dec. 31, and said the outlook reflects its confidence in the underlying strength of the business..\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Microsoft\uc2  Increases Xbox Prices, Citing Soaring Memory Costs\par \par \uc2 Prices will go up by $100 for 512-gigabyte models and $150 for 1-terabyte models, effective Aug. 1.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 FCC\uc2 's Carr Says ABC Is Running a 'Campaign of Misinformation' on Probe\par \par \uc2 The regulator says the \uc2 Disney\uc2  broadcaster's TV spots about the agency's inquiry into "The View" are misleading.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 U.S. Bans Polestar, Chinese-Owned EV Maker, From Selling Cars in the U.S.\par \par \uc2 A government rule prohibiting Chinese software in cars resulted in Polestar bowing out of the U.S. market.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Meta\uc2  Tried to Silence Her. Now She's Suing.\par \par \uc2 Sarah Wynn-Williams, a former \uc2 Facebook\uc2  policy executive, is suing \uc2 Meta\uc2  over its attempts to stop her from talking about her book, "Careless People," a \uc2 New York Times\uc2  bestseller.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Germany's \uc2 Merck\uc2  to Boost Lab-Tools Business With $11 Billion Bio-Techne Deal\par \par \uc2 The proposed acquisition will be the company's biggest deal in more than a decade and represents an early move by new CEO \uc2 Kai Beckmann\uc2  to bolster the business.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Darden\uc2  Posts Higher Sales but Warns of Slower Growth\par \par \uc2 Darden\uc2  posted higher profit and sales in its fiscal fourth quarter, once again led by its LongHorn Steakhouse brand, but expects growth to slow over the coming year.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 BlackBerry\uc2  Sees New AI Opportunities as Embedded-Software Business Accelerates\par \par \uc2 The company lifted its fiscal 2027 outlook on higher first-quarter results, driven by embedded-software growth and expanding opportunities with \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Wendy's Meme Rally Took a Pause. Short Sellers Are on Watch.\par \par \uc2 The struggling fast-food chain is seeing more action than the red-hot memory-chip maker, which just posted stellar earnings.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Winnebago\uc2  Cuts Outlook Amid Declining Sales\par \par \uc2 The motorhome maker posted a fiscal third-quarter profit of $14.5 million, or 51 cents a share, compared with $17.6 million, or 62 cents a share, in the same quarter a year ago.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 McCormick\uc2  Posts Higher Sales Amid Combination With \uc2 Unilever\par \par \uc2 The maker of spices and seasonings reported higher sales in its fiscal second quarter, as it continues work to combine with \uc2 Unilever\uc2 's food business.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Anthropic\uc2  Claims Alibaba Ran 'Brazen' Campaign to Access Its \uc2 Claude AI\uc2  Model\par \par \uc2 U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial-intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  lab \uc2 Anthropic\uc2  has accused Chinese e-commerce giant \uc2 Alibaba\uc2  of "illicitly" accessing its frontier model Claude to harvest its capabilities.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 25, 2026 17:00 ET (21:00 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260625em6p003p6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
