\par\par \b \uc2 Press Release: \uc2 JetCool\uc2  Launches Turnkey Liquid-Cooled Server Solution to Accelerate Enterprise AI Adoption\b0\par\par\uc2 877 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2026\par 22:05\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 New platform delivers direct-to-chip liquid cooling with end-to-end infrastructure and services, simplifying enterprise deployment of high-density AI compute\par \par \uc2 AUSTIN, Texas, June 25, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- \uc2 JetCool\uc2 , a Flex (NASDAQ: FLEX) company and leading provider of advanced cooling for AI and high-density computing, today announced the launch of a liquid-cooled version of the \uc2 Dell\uc2  PowerEdge XE7745 server. The solution combines a fully integrated, liquid-cooled system with commissioning, deployment, and ongoing maintenance services, along with unified warranty coverage across the server and cooling environment. Delivered tested and ready to deploy, it reduces risk, variability, and complexity for enterprise customers.\par \par \uc2 By bringing together server, cooling, and lifecycle services in a single offering, \uc2 JetCool\uc2  provides a streamlined path to adopt cost-effective, high-density AI infrastructure through a single, accountable partner.\par \par \uc2 Liquid-Cooled XE7745 Servers: Performance Without Compromise\par \par \uc2 The liquid-cooled Dell PowerEdge XE7745 is based on a proven platform recognized for high performance, density, and cost efficiency. Purpose-built for demanding AI, HPC, and GPU-accelerated workloads, it supports dual 5th Gen AMD EPYC processors and up to eight high-density \uc2 NVIDIA\uc2  RTX PRO(TM) 6000 Blackwell GPUs.\par \par \uc2 To manage these intensive computing demands, \uc2 JetCool\uc2 's SmartPlate direct-to-chip liquid cooling removes heat directly from the silicon, effectively managing sustained loads of up to 8 kW per server. This precision-engineered thermal solution delivers substantial efficiency and performance gains over the air-cooled configuration: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    -- Superior Thermal Margin: Reduces CPU temperatures by up to 7% and GPU \par       temperatures by up to 11%, helping to maximize performance and prevent \par       thermal throttling under heavy workloads. \par  \par    -- Significant Power Savings: Achieves up to a 30% reduction in total server \par       power consumption by reducing fan speed up to 70% and fan power by up to \par       50%. \par  \par    -- Dramatically Quieter Operation: Lowers acoustic output by up to 23 dB, an \par       approximately 80% reduction in perceived noise per server. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 By optimizing heat transfer at the chip level, the liquid cooling frees up valuable power and cooling capacity at the rack level, allowing enterprises to deploy more compute density into their existing data center footprints.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Designed for rapid, efficient deployment, the system utilizes low-flow operation, allowing enterprises to replace older, less-dense servers without disrupting their existing facility water loops. To simplify the upgrade process, \f28 \uc2 \f2 JetCool\f28 \uc2 \f2  provides the entire rack-level infrastructure, including the physical racks, mounting hardware, CDUs, manifolds, and fluid distribution equipment, delivering a complete, factory-tested assembly that is ready to install.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Value of an End-to-End Approach\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 By bringing together the server, cooling, infrastructure, lifecycle services, and warranty into a single, coordinated offering, \f28 \uc2 \f2 JetCool\f28 \uc2 \f2  simplifies how liquid-cooled systems are procured, deployed, and operated. A single point of support and accountability spans system configuration, delivery, and support, reducing vendor complexity and eliminating gaps in ownership.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Powered by Flex's global manufacturing footprint, supply chain depth, and service capabilities, the \f28 \uc2 \f2 JetCool\f28 \uc2 \f2  solution delivers the consistency and execution that enterprises need to deploy and scale confidently across data centers and regions.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Scaling next-generation AI demands a leap forward in compute density, but the real key to success is bringing that power online quickly, safely, and efficiently," said \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bernie Malouin\f28 \uc2 \f2 , Founder of \f28 \uc2 \f2 JetCool\f28 \uc2 \f2  and Vice President at Flex. "By delivering the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dell\f28 \uc2 \f2  PowerEdge XE7745 as a fully integrated, liquid-cooled system backed by end-to-end services, we're taking the risk out of high-density deployments. We're giving operators a reliable path to get peak performance out of their hardware while keeping their existing facility running predictably."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The liquid-cooled Dell PowerEdge XE7745 platform is available directly from \f28 \uc2 \f2 JetCool\f28 \uc2 \f2 . To learn more, visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://jetcool.com/Dell"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://jetcool.com/Dell}}}\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 About Flex\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Flex (Reg. No. 199002645H) is the manufacturing partner of choice that helps leading brands design, build, and manage products that improve the world. With a global footprint spanning 30 countries, Flex delivers advanced manufacturing and supply chain solutions, innovative products and technology, and lifecycle services that support customers from concept to scale. In the AI era, Flex is helping customers accelerate data center deployment by solving power, heat, and scale challenges through cutting-edge power and cooling technology and scalable IT infrastructure solutions.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For information about Flex's intent to spin off its Cloud and Power infrastructure portfolio, visit: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://investors.flex.com/transaction-resources/default.aspx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://investors.flex.com/transaction-resources/default.aspx}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 About JetCool\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 JetCool, a Flex company, is a global leader in advanced thermal management for compute-intensive applications. Trusted by top chipmakers, OEMs, and data centers, JetCool delivers a portfolio of liquid cooling solutions that enhance performance, increase energy efficiency, and support sustainability goals. Engineered for the demands of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 artificial intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (AI) and next-generation computing, JetCool technologies deliver reliable, scalable performance for data centers around the world.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Contacts\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Media & Press\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Christie Haber\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Senior Director, Commercial Marketing\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (602) 245-1057\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Christie.Haber@flex.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Investors & Analysts\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Michelle Simmons\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Senior Vice President, Global Investor Relations and Public Relations\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (669) 242-6332\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Michelle.Simmons@flex.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 View original content to download multimedia:\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/jetcool-launches-turnkey-liquid-cooled-server-solution-to-accelerate-enterprise-ai-adoption-302811212.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/jetcool-launches-turnkey-liquid-cooled-server-solution-to-accelerate-enterprise-ai-adoption-302811212.html}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 SOURCE Flex\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 June 25, 2026 16:05 ET (20:05 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260625em6p003a9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
