\par\par \b \uc2 ON Semiconductor to Buy Synaptics in All-Stock Deal with $7B Enterprise Value\b0\par\par\uc2 By Elias Schisgall \par \uc2 259 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2026\par 22:35\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 ON Semiconductor\uc2  agreed to acquire \uc2 Synaptics\uc2  in an all-stock transaction with an enterprise value of around $7 billion.\par \par \uc2 The chip maker on Thursday said it will issue 1.35 shares for each share of \uc2 Synaptics\uc2 , which it said represents a roughly 19% premium to the two stocks' volume-weighted average prices over the last 10 trading days.\par \par \uc2 Shares of ON Semiconductor fell 7.3% to $110.12 after hours.\par \par \uc2 ON Semiconductor\uc2  said \uc2 Synaptics\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial-intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  compute platform, human-machine interface technology, and connectivity solutions would help it meet demand for increasingly capable AI solutions that can interact with the physical world.\par \par \uc2 "This shift towards Physical AI will require Power, Sense, Connected Compute and Control to work together seamlessly," ON Semiconductor Chief Executive \uc2 Hassane El-Khoury\uc2  said. "The addition of \uc2 Synaptics\uc2  helps position \uc2 onsemi\uc2  at the intersection of these four pillars, enabling us to capture a significantly larger AI opportunity that extends beyond AI data center and into edge applications."\par \par \uc2 The company expects the acquisition to be accretive to adjusted per-share earnings within 18 months of closing, adding that it will drive an expected $200 million in annual synergies and gross margins.\par \par \uc2 One member of the \uc2 Synaptics\uc2  board will join \uc2 ON Semiconductor\uc2 's board as part of the deal, expected to close in the middle of next year.\par \par \uc2 Write to Elias Schisgall at elias.schisgall@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 25, 2026 16:35 ET (20:35 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260625em6p003iv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
